   ],
   "x": "Kavi Samrat is Viswanatha Satyanarayana, not Rayaprolu, so B is not correct. Rayaprolu is the Father of Telugu Romanticism and wrote Andhravali; some lists also call him Abhinava Nannaya, though the APPSC G2 2025 key gave that title to Viswanatha."
  },
